    <div class="shade-info">
      <span class="shade-number">No. 02</span>
      <h3 class="shade-name">Drum, Pleated</h3>
      <p class="shade-desc">Even pleating around a circular frame. Warm light diffuses through the folds and casts a soft pattern on the ceiling.</p>
      <div class="shade-specs">
        <span class="shade-spec">Ø 40 cm</span>
        <span class="shade-spec">H 30 cm</span>
        <span class="shade-spec">E27</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shade-footer">
        <span class="shade-avail">Available</span>
        <a href="/oder-redo-contact.html" class="shade-inquire">Inquire →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="shade-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
    <div class="shade-img">
      <div class="shade-placeholder"><p class="ph-label">Shade — 03</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="shade-info">
      <span class="shade-number">No. 03</span>
      <h3 class="shade-name">Ribbed Oval</h3>
      <p class="shade-desc">Vertical ribs give structure to an oval form. Slightly warm paper tone, good for living rooms and dining spaces.</p>
      <div class="shade-specs">
        <span class="shade-spec">Ø 35 cm</span>
        <span class="shade-spec">H 28 cm</span>
        <span class="shade-spec">E27</span>
      </div>
      <div class="shade-footer">
        <span class="shade-avail">Available</span>
        <a href="/oder-redo-contact.html" class="shade-inquire">Inquire →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="shade-card reveal">
    <div class="shade-img">
      <div class="shade-placeholder"><p class="ph-label">Shade — 04</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="shade-info">
      <span class="shade-number">No. 04</span>
      <h3 class="shade-name">Flat Disc</h3>
      <p class="shade-desc">Wide and low — designed for spaces with lower ceilings or as a statement piece over a dining table.</p>
      <div class="shade-specs">
        <span class="shade-spec">Ø 55 cm</span>
